WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.876
felt the car hit something and stop moving.

2
00:00:17.896 --> 00:00:20.098
"Are you okay?"

3
00:00:20.579 --> 00:00:21.519
Roxy's mom asked.

4
00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:22.800
Terrell nodded.

5
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:26.083
"Good." Roxy's mom unbuckled her seat belt.

6
00:00:26.703 --> 00:00:28.505
"Now do exactly what I say.

7
00:00:29.005 --> 00:00:32.068
We're going to slowly climb out of the—" Boom!

8
00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:34.745
Boom! The ground shook.

9
00:00:35.385 --> 00:00:36.866
Terrell clung to his seat belt.

10
00:00:36.886 --> 00:00:39.747
"Is that another earthquake?"

11
00:00:39.787 --> 00:00:42.708
Crunch! Something smashed the back end of the car.

12
00:00:43.128 --> 00:00:44.409
The car began to rise.

13
00:00:44.429 --> 00:00:47.030
"Something's pulling us out!"

14
00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:48.270
Roxy's mom said.

15
00:00:49.651 --> 00:00:51.612
Soon the car was back on flat ground.

16
00:00:52.192 --> 00:00:52.912
They climbed out.

17
00:00:54.293 --> 00:00:56.574
"We're safe," Roxy's mom said.

18
00:00:56.594 --> 00:01:00.215
"But what A giant robot stood over them.

19
00:01:01.056 --> 00:01:01.936
Terrell smiled.

20
00:01:02.584 --> 00:01:03.685
"Dr. Odd!"

21
00:01:04.526 --> 00:01:06.547
The robot's head popped open, and Dr.

22
00:01:06.628 --> 00:01:07.208
Odd waved.

23
00:01:07.809 --> 00:01:08.989
Bippo sat on his shoulder.

24
00:01:09.009 --> 00:01:12.813
"Safe, you!"

25
00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:15.955
"I still don't know what's causing the earthquakes," Dr.

26
00:01:16.035 --> 00:01:16.496
Odd said.

27
00:01:16.516 --> 00:01:19.338
"But I think I can find Rocket Girl."

28
00:01:20.039 --> 00:01:21.580
Terrell and Roxy's mom were in Dr.

29
00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:23.942
Odd's mobile lab, which had a big computer screen.

30
00:01:23.962 --> 00:01:28.125
"We can't reach her by phone," Roxy's mom said.

31
00:01:28.145 --> 00:01:30.807
"I can't either," Dr.

32
00:01:30.907 --> 00:01:31.368
Odd said.

33
00:01:32.016 --> 00:01:34.878
"I think there's a firewall blocking our calls.

34
00:01:35.399 --> 00:01:37.500
But this lab has a powerful antenna.

35
00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:41.403
Maybe its signal can break through the firewall.

36
00:01:42.264 --> 00:01:45.506
Then we can talk to her, or at least locate her."

37
00:01:46.186 --> 00:01:48.068
His contacts appeared on the screen.

38
00:01:48.088 --> 00:01:50.509
"You're friends with Von Buzz?"

39
00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:52.711
"He's not so bad."

40
00:01:53.492 --> 00:01:55.553
Dr. Odd pressed the icon for Rocket Girl.

41
00:01:56.053 --> 00:01:59.376
A message appeared on the computer's screen: No Connection.

42
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.761
"I'll adjust the antenna's position."

43
00:02:03.301 --> 00:02:04.881
Dr. Odd typed in some code.

44
00:02:08.722 --> 00:02:11.103
The same message appeared: No Connection.

45
00:02:11.903 --> 00:02:12.703
Terrell groaned.

46
00:02:14.524 --> 00:02:16.525
Roxy's mom drummed her fingers on the desk.

47
00:02:17.145 --> 00:02:18.385
Dr. Odd waved a hand.

48
00:02:18.965 --> 00:02:19.665
"Don't worry.

49
00:02:19.965 --> 00:02:22.866
We just need to get the antenna in the right position."

50
00:02:22.886 --> 00:02:25.607
"This stinks!"

51
00:02:26.007 --> 00:02:26.627
Roxy said.

52
00:02:27.227 --> 00:02:28.948
Cozlin frowned at the food on her plate.

53
00:02:29.664 --> 00:02:30.285
"I agree.

54
00:02:30.665 --> 00:02:32.706
Space beans are gross."

55
00:02:33.626 --> 00:02:36.948
The friends were in a cafeteria where all the fighters were eating and talking.

56
00:02:36.968 --> 00:02:40.230
"I'm not talking about the food," Roxy said.

57
00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:42.291
"I'm mad that I'm stuck here.

58
00:02:42.831 --> 00:02:44.572
Metro City is in danger!"

59
00:02:44.592 --> 00:02:48.435
"I need to get back to the Tang Monk," Wukong said.

60
00:02:49.295 --> 00:02:50.196
Cozlin sighed.

61
00:02:50.216 --> 00:02:52.617
"I have to get back to Delkor.

62
00:02:53.217 --> 00:02:55.338
Sapphire caused so much damage.

63
00:02:55.979 --> 00:02:57.900
I need to help fix everything."

64
00:02:58.784 --> 00:02:59.564
Roxy snorted.

65
00:02:59.584 --> 00:03:01.905
"Yeah. It was your fault."

66
00:03:02.565 --> 00:03:04.086
"I know it's my fault!"

67
00:03:04.606 --> 00:03:05.746
Cozlin waved her hand.

68
00:03:06.466 --> 00:03:08.147
Space beans flew off her fork.

69
00:03:09.047 --> 00:03:09.927
A voice growled.

70
00:03:10.207 --> 00:03:11.187
"Who threw that?"

71
00:03:11.988 --> 00:03:12.928
Roxy looked over.

72
00:03:14.148 --> 00:03:16.089
A large creature with tentacles stood up.

73
00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:18.209
Space beans dripped from its head.

74
00:03:18.229 --> 00:03:21.290
"Sorry," Cozlin said.

75
00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.271
"That was—" Wham!

76
00:03:23.971 --> 00:03:25.651
A bowl of slop hit her in the face.

77
00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:29.957
"Grr!" Cozlin flung the rest of her meal at the creature.

78
00:03:30.498 --> 00:03:33.839
The creature ducked, and the food hit an alien sitting nearby.

79
00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:35.520
Wukong laughed.

80
00:03:37.061 --> 00:03:39.123
The alien wiped the food from its face.

81
00:03:39.143 --> 00:03:40.904
"You think that's funny?"

82
00:03:43.805 --> 00:03:46.106
Soon food was flying in every direction.

83
00:03:46.127 --> 00:03:50.229
"Everyone, stop!"

84
00:03:50.749 --> 00:03:51.470
Roxy shouted.

85
00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:53.271
The room grew quiet.

86
00:03:53.291 --> 00:03:55.352
"We shouldn't fight each other.

87
00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:58.242
We should work together to escape!"

88
00:03:59.002 --> 00:03:59.923
Glytar laughed.

89
00:04:00.583 --> 00:04:01.924
"No way!

90
00:04:01.944 --> 00:04:04.626
I want that golden asteroid!"

91
00:04:04.646 --> 00:04:07.268
"Well, too bad for you!"

92
00:04:07.809 --> 00:04:08.489
a bug said.

93
00:04:08.509 --> 00:04:11.852
"Because I'm going to win this competition!"

94
00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:13.053
"No, you're not!"

95
00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:14.173
someone shouted.

96
00:04:14.874 --> 00:04:18.416
As all the fighters argued, Roxy heard a familiar beeping sound.

97
00:04:19.337 --> 00:04:20.178
It was her watch.

98
00:04:20.618 --> 00:04:22.199
Roxy opened it and smiled.
